dd3810d0f518e970fe46a942142d0460635c9d4ff6be32e\",\"Among retrenched PMETs who have found work again, about six in 10 earn more than before their retrenchment at both the 12 and 24-month marks.\",{\"_256\":829,\"_258\":830,\"_240\":831,\"_309\":832},\"9540981\",\"As Malaysia’s chip goals morph into a multi-state model, are they outgrowing Penang?\",\"/pulse/article/9540981\",{\"_803\":833,\"_805\":834,\"_323\":330,\"_325\":331},\"https://cassette.sphdigital.com.sg/image/businesstimes/e74996f5f30f8b0845884828181fa5b2ba0710b41d88a7caec333130b6025628\",\"Intel Malaysia's Penang facility. The country’s chip ambitions have become too large and technologically diverse to be contained within a single state.\",{\"_256\":836,\"_258\":837,\"_240\":838,\"_309\":839},\"9786343\",\"Hao Mart owner resisting OG’s mortgage foreclosure on his Tanglin GCB\",\"/pulse/article/9786343\",{\"_803\":840,\"_805\":841,\"_323\":330,\"_325\":331},\"https://cassette.sphdigital.com.sg/image/businesstimes/75de03295ebff4f15ec229504ac8817ad24012087f88d7d772575a10e0086d4b\",\"Hao Mart was evicted by department store operator OG on alleged rental arrears and breaches of the lease agreement, less than two years into the lease.\",{\"_256\":843,\"_258\":844,\"_240\":845,\"_309\":846},\"9707827\",\"If AI has a one-in-five chance of destroying us, what do we do with the remaining four?\",\"/pulse/article/9707827\",{\"_803\":847,\"_805\":848,\"_323\":330,\"_325\":331},\"https://cassette.sphdigital.com.sg/image/businesstimes/c7ffb7ef278f401ddf2d461d61215682b8c2257a5ad35f831888e5214162cc29\",\"Nine of the 12 leading AI companies had set thresholds for when models warrant caution, only to move the goalposts as competitive pressures mounted.\",{\"_256\":850,\"_258\":851,\"_240\":852,\"_261\":26,\"_262\":853,\"_264\":854,\"_265\":266,\"_267\":855,\"_269\":856,\"_271\":857,\"_273\":858,\"_233\":871,\"_309\":875,\"_340\":876,\"_342\":266,\"_343\":877,\"_345\":26,\"_346\":-7,\"_347\":-7,\"_348\":26,\"_350\":857,\"_878\":879,\"_883\":884,\"_889\":26,\"_890\":26,\"_891\":892,\"_893\":266,\"_894\":895,\"_896\":897,\"_902\":26,\"_903\":904,\"_905\":906},\"2657496\",\"2 online shopping sites bag venture funding\",\"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/startups-tech/technology/2-online-shopping-sites-bag-venture-funding\",\"2016-03-23T13:50:00.000Z\",\"2018-08-28T09:41:05.000Z\",\"premium\",\"SPH\",\"Ezbuy raises US$20m, plans new source markets; iFashion gets S$1m, guns for regional expansion\",[859,865],{\"_256\":860,\"_236\":861,\"_5\":278,\"_261\":26,\"_240\":862,\"_280\":863,\"_233\":864},\"54502\",\"E-commerce\",\"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/keywords/e-commerce\",[862],[],{\"_256\":866,\"_236\":867,\"_5\":278,\"_261\":26,\"_240\":868,\"_280\":869,\"_233\":870},\"2387\",\"Taobao\",\"https://www.businesstimes.com.sg/keywords/taobao\",[868],[],[872,874],{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_293\":303,\"_240\":241,\"_242\":873},{\"_236\":244,\"_238\":245,\"_240\":246},{\"_236\":244,\"_238\":245,\"_293\":294,\"_240\":246,\"_242\":-7},[],[],\"onlineStory\",\"body\",[880,881,882],\"\u003cp\u003eSingapore\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003eTHE e-commerce game is strong in Singapore. Homegrown platforms ezbuy (known formerly as 65daigou and which provides Taobao shopping services) and iFashion (a new roll-up play which targets online fashion sites) have raised US$20 million and S$1 million respectively in venture capital, amid a competitive landscape.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"\u003cp\u003eOn Wednesday, ezbuy - an aggregator shopping site that connects Singapore customers directly to overseas online merchants from Taobao (China), the US and Taiwan - announced its Series B round led by Vision Knight Capital and joined by existing investors IDG Ventures and CGC Capital.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"sentiment\",{\"_885\":886,\"_887\":888},\"provider\",\"Grapeshot\",\"keywords\",\"ias_1518374_pg,ias_1518336_pg,ias_3017612_pg,ias_3005071_pg,ias_1518407_pg,ias_3017845_pg,ias_3017826_pg,ias_1518588_pg,ias_1522513_pg,ias